<title>PHILIPPINES: First Abacus 9-mth net 111.9 mln pesos. [CORRECTED 07:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>First Abacus 9-mth net 111.9 mln pesos. [CORRECTED 07:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Abacus Financial Holdings Corp said on Tuesday its net income in the January to September period amounted to 111.914 million pesos (corrects from 111.914 billion pesos).  </p>
<p>The company's consolidated revenues for the period reached 261.965 million pesos.</p>
<p>First Abacus is engaged in stock broking and investment banking.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937 (c) Reuters Limited 1996</p>
